{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302060","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130206001:1":{"text":"응, 석양 전투장에 물건 팔러 가.","source_cn":"是的，我要去武斗场卖些东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC22E57730442783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130206002:1":{"text":"전부 내 탓이야. 전투장이 바로 코앞에 있다는 생각에 발밑을 살피지 못했어.","source_cn":"都怪我，想着武斗场就在前方，结果忘记观察脚下的路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD033E65B167EBF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130206003:1":{"text":"카트도 모래에 빠져버리고, 이 물건들은 또 어떻게 다 옮기지...?","source_cn":"现在推车陷入到沙子里出不来，我这些货物该怎么搬过去呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x084EF9FCEE2900BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血商人芒特":{"text":"트라이브 상인 몬티","source":"蛮血商人芒特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}